          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The main processing code must be ran before figures can be generated. The data files must be in a folder called 'Data' that is stored in the same folder as the processing code. An error will be thrown if data cannot be found. All individual trials (Epochs) are collected a single MATLAB table, where each row corresponds to a trial. This table contains columns corresponding to the subject number, group, condition, and other metrics. The column 'T' stores the full timeseries data of each epoch."
